  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would love to see an attachment based system or something similar that would allow content creators to upload avatar body parts, clothes, hair, faces, etc allowing us essentially to create our own personal and individual avatars giving us a vastly superior amount of customization and control over how our avatars look vs the current method of going and picking a full avatar. Right now as it stands with the current system, the avatars are all rather limited since most are recolors or just flat re-uploads of previous models already used around VRChat. You see this type of system in games like Second Life where personal avatar items are treated as attachments and are interchangeable then refreshed once put on. The loading times may also see an improvement since I would think it would take less time to load in a shirt rather than say a full avatar. The system could be broken down into body parts such as Body (Choosing your body type / skin texture associated with it) Head (For the shape of head you want) / Eyes (Shape of eyes and or eye color or just the eye color) Hair and even further depending on how detailed you wanted to get with it.",
